{"channelId":"UCCApMDpNNYD801k8P2ROVeg","row":["Forgotten Ones",18,"The Forgotten Ones Animal Rescue is a 501(c)3 non-profit, foster-based animal rescue located in Midlothian, Texas. Our passion is helping animals that are injured or sick and suffering in the streets and our local shelters. Our dogs live in loving homes from the minute we get them.  All of our Foster Moms and Dads are volunteers.  They show them love, gain their trust, and make each dog a loving part of their family, until their forever family can be found. Come along with us and be part of their journey.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCApMDpNNYD801k8P2ROVeg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCApMDpNNYD801k8P2ROVeg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:34.222Z","channelId":"UCCApMDpNNYD801k8P2ROVeg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"91e97d392b2133d3bef4836d03955cb78ae2e27e4727a90757d445d8fb0b385c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"98561cc999a5fe2c252e912ffbda057435830581a0b45c3a0e887c7da6f12bcd"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCApMDpNNYD801k8P2ROVeg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:34.222Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCApMDpNNYD801k8P2ROVeg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":18,"raw":"18 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCApMDpNNYD801k8P2ROVeg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:34.222Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCApMDpNNYD801k8P2ROVeg"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords":["animal rescue"],"role":"undetermined","exc